<title>UK: FEK sets 15 billion yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 15 billion yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY   *28.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K)  500</p>
<p> NOTES     *REDEMPTION IN NEW ZEALAND DOLLARS</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
